            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display panel comprises:a first pixel circuit; anda second pixel circuit adjacent to the first pixel circuit,wherein each of the first pixel circuit and the second pixel circuit comprises:a driving transistor (T1) configured to output a driving current to a display element;a first transistor (T4) comprising a first semiconductor layer and configured to transmit a first initialization voltage (Vint) to a gate electrode of the driving transistor; anda second transistor (T8) comprising a second semiconductor layer and configured to transmit a second initialization voltage (Vaint) to a pixel electrode of the display element,wherein the first initialization voltage (Vint) provided to the first pixel circuit and the first initialization voltage (Vint) provided to the second pixel circuit are the same,wherein the second initialization voltage (Vaint) provided to the first pixel circuit and the second initialization voltage (Vaint) provided to the second pixel circuit are different each other, andwherein the first semiconductor layer comprises an oxide semiconductor.</p>
            </abstract>
